=== ANSWER A ===
COMMANDS RUN:
 - Read: {"file_path": "<home>/.claude/skills/caveman/SKILL.md"}
 - Bash: cat .git-blame-ignore-revs; git ls-files | grep -vE '(^|/)(node_modules)/' | head -300 | wc -l; git ls-files | head -80
 - Bash: cd "$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)"; for f in $(git ls-files | grep -vE 'LICENSE|\.yml$'); do git blame -w -M -C --ignore-revs-file .git-blame-ignore-revs --line-porcelain "$f" 2>/dev/null | grep -a '^author ' | sed 's/^author //' | sed "s|^|$f\t|"; done > /tmp/blame.tsv; echo TOTAL; cut -f2 /tmp/blame.tsv | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn | head -15; echo; echo LIB; grep '^lib/' /tmp/blame.tsv | cut -f2 | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn | head -8; echo TESTS; grep '^test/' /tmp/blame.tsv | cut -f2 | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn | head -8; git rev-list --count HEAD; git shortlog -sn HEAD | head -5
 - Bash: wc -l < /tmp/blame.tsv; grep -E '^(lib|test)/' /tmp/blame.tsv | wc -l; grep -E '^(HISTORY|README)' /tmp/blame.tsv | cut -f1,2 | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn | head -6
FINAL ANSWER:
Troy Goode owns most of the surviving code. Their share is about 50% of all lines and about 57% of the code in `lib/` and `test/`. Douglas Christopher Wilson is second.

I used `git blame` on the current files, with `-w -M -C` so whitespace changes and moved lines don't count as authorship. I also passed `.git-blame-ignore-revs` so the 4-space/double-quote reformat commit (`62628c0`) doesn't credit its author with every line. I left out LICENSE and the `.yml` config files. That leaves 1,592 lines.

**All counted files (1,592 lines)**
| Author | Lines | Share |
|---|---|---|
| Troy Goode | 805 | ~51% |
| Douglas Christopher Wilson | 485 | ~30% |
| Jon Church | 72 | ~4.5% |
| Alejandro Caravaca Puchades | 30 | ~2% |
| Linus Unnebäck | 26 | ~1.6% |
| Everyone else | each 17 lines or fewer | ~11% combined |

**`lib/index.js`, the actual implementation**
- Troy Goode has 159 lines.
- Douglas Christopher Wilson has 22.
- Alejandro Caravaca Puchades has 12.
- Raymond Feng has 7.
- max.laverse and LuisEGR have 6 each.

**`test/`**
- Troy Goode has 517 lines.
- Douglas Christopher Wilson has 372.
- Alejandro Caravaca Puchades has 18.

**Docs**
- Jon Church, Linus Unnebäck and Ollie Buck have most of the README lines outside Troy Goode's.
- Douglas Christopher Wilson has 50 lines in `HISTORY.md`.

Commit counts tell a different story. Douglas Christopher Wilson has 143 of the 355 commits and Troy Goode has 122. Douglas Christopher Wilson's commits are mostly maintenance: changelog entries, dependency bumps and test edits.

Two things could shift these numbers. `-C` can credit copied lines to the original author, and the reformat commit is the only revision I excluded. Other bulk edits are still credited to whoever made them.
